==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|tolmetsche}}. Compare {{cog|sla-pro|*tъlmačь||interpreter}} ({{cog|ru|sc=Cyrl|толма́ч}},{{cog|pl|tłumacz}}), {{cog|hu|tolmács}}, borrowed from a {{der|de|trk|-}} language, from {{der|de|trk-pro|*tilmaç}} (cf. {{cog|tr|dilmaç||translator, interpreter}}).

